  "brand_content": {
    "story": {
      "title": {
        "zh": "三眼井畔，三里田的由来",
        "en": "The Origin of Sanlitian"
      },
      "short_summary": {
        "zh": "三里田供氧客栈坐落于丽江古城三眼井旁， 以古井、田园、清风与温暖待客文化为品牌根基， 希望为每一位旅人提供安心呼吸、舒适入眠、如家般温暖的旅居体验。\n",
        "en": "Sanlitian Oxygen Boutique Guesthouse stands beside Three-Eyed Well in Lijiang Old Town. Its brand is rooted in the ancient well, the surrounding fields, fresh air, and warm family-style hospitality.\n"
      },
      "full_story_zh": "远山藏古韵，古井润人间。在山野田畔的烟火深处，静静伫立着一口百年三眼井，也藏着三里田供氧客栈温柔绵长的由来。\n\n相传古时此地山林繁茂、田亩连绵，村民依山拓田、择水而居。早年山间偶有云雾氤氲，空气潮湿沉闷，每逢雨季，行路劳作皆觉憋闷。彼时山中清泉涌动，唯独此处泉眼最为澄澈灵动，为解乡民困顿，先人寻得灵泉脉络，以青石凿造三眼井口，一眼润田、一眼养人、一眼净风。三眼井三孔同源、清泉互通，汩汩活水常年不竭，滋养着周遭良田，也涤荡着山间浊气，让这片山野常年清风流转、空气清新，四季温润通透。\n\n一方古井，养一方水土，造一方清风。这片被古井滋养的田地，便得名三里田。千百年来，三眼井的灵泉活水浸润土地、净化山林，让这里植被葱郁、负氧充盈，自成一方天然氧吧，远离尘世喧嚣，常年清风拂面、温润舒心。\n\n后来，有人择古井之畔、良田之侧，建起一座山野客栈，便取名三里田供氧客栈。\n\n取名三里田，是铭记这片良田沃土的烟火温柔，承袭三眼井千年滋养的温润底蕴；冠以供氧二字，是坚守此地独有的山野灵气，留住古井清风、山林鲜氧。不逐繁华，只守清宁，客栈依田而建、傍井而居，枕山野清风，伴古井流泉。\n\n世人奔赴山野，寻的是清净，盼的是舒心。在这里，推门可见良田阡陌，移步可访千年三眼古井，晨起吸氧听风，暮时观云赏田。一院清宁，满目青绿，一井灵泉，满室鲜氧，便是三里田供氧客栈赠予每一位旅人，最治愈的山野浪漫。\n",
      "full_story_en": "Ancient charm rests in the distant mountains, while an old well nourishes everyday life.\n\nBeside the century-old Three-Eyed Well in Lijiang Old Town stands Sanlitian Oxygen Boutique Guesthouse. The story of Sanlitian is rooted in the fields, spring water, mountain air, and generations of local life around this place.\n\nAccording to local tradition, the area was once surrounded by forests and farmland. People settled near the water and cultivated the land. The Three-Eyed Well, carved from stone and fed by one continuous spring, became part of daily life: one opening served the fields, one served the people, and one helped keep the surroundings fresh and clean.\n\nOver time, the land nourished by this spring became known as Sanlitian. The old well, green landscape, and gentle mountain climate created a peaceful corner away from the noise of the city.\n\nThe guesthouse was later established beside the well and fields and named Sanlitian Oxygen Boutique Guesthouse. The name remembers the warmth of the land and the heritage of the Three-Eyed Well, while “oxygen” represents the property’s commitment to a more comfortable high-altitude stay.\n\nSanlitian does not pursue noise or excess. It offers a quiet courtyard, flowing spring water, greenery, fresh air, and a warm place to rest. Guests can wake to the breeze, walk to the old well, enjoy the landscape, and experience the slower rhythm of Lijiang.\n"
    },
    "mission": {
      "zh": "让每一位来到丽江的旅人，都能安心呼吸、舒适入眠，轻松感受古城最真实的慢生活。",
      "en": "To help every traveler breathe easier, sleep better, and truly enjoy the slow rhythm of Lijiang."
    },
    "vision": {
      "zh": "成为丽江古城最值得信赖、最具代表性的供氧精品客栈。",
      "en": "To become the most trusted and representative oxygen boutique guesthouse in Lijiang Old Town."
    },
    "promise": {
      "zh": "在三里田，每位旅人都能拥有一个安心休息、自在呼吸、像家一样温暖的地方。",
      "en": "At Sanlitian, every traveler can find a warm place to breathe freely, rest peacefully, and feel at home."
    },
    "guest_memory": {
      "zh": "在中国云南丽江三里田，还有一个温暖的家，还有一群家人。",
      "en": "In Sanlitian, Lijiang, there is always a warm home and a family waiting to welcome you back."
    },
